{
  "name": "@memberjunction/ng-realtime-channel-examples",
  "version": "6.2.0-edge.1",
  "description": "MemberJunction: worked examples for building realtime-agent channels. A tic-tac-toe channel built ONLY by wrapping a plain Angular component with AngularComponentChannel, with tests that play a whole game with interleaved agent and user moves. Not loaded by default: import it, call LoadExampleTicTacToeChannel(), and bring it to a session as a host channel.",
